# The items that approve a SNIF name by VES in the "snif" domain
# (inc/snif-auth-ves.php, README "X-VES-Authorization"): one external id per
# line, {email} standing for the item's creator's email. The authorization
# page at https://snif.host/auth approves with its user's {email}!snif-auth.
{email}!snif-auth
